lidation, and the validation quota is exhausted, so the conclusion remains dataset-specific association rather than causal or generalizable biology. I requested no new validation. I registered no new comparisons because the remaining useful work is raw-data inspection, not further subgroup mining: inspect raw outcome_014 distributions by feature_027, source/batch indicators, missingness, scale transformations, and possible leakage, and externally validate feature_065/outcome_013 if possible.",
